  - m_Id: 1522245204697164
    m_Localized: Reaction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697165
    m_Localized: Wait for the stimulus. When it appears, respond as quickly as possible. False starts may count against you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697166
    m_Localized: Aim precision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697167
    m_Localized: Targets will appear in the field. Tap each target as accurately and quickly as the task allows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697168
    m_Localized: Memory sequence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697169
    m_Localized: Memorize the pattern or sequence shown, then reproduce it within the time limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697170
    m_Localized: Rhythm timing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697171
    m_Localized: Follow the rhythm cues. Your timing error determines the outcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697172
    m_Localized: Multiple object tracking (MOT)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697173
    m_Localized: Track the marked objects as they move. Identify them when prompted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697174
    m_Localized: Bullet Hell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1522245204697175
    m_Localized: Avoid projectiles and survive as long as possible. Movement is constrained to the play area.
